{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah, the Amazon Rainforest, a land of great biological diversity, yet once again at risk. This time, these workers intend to destroy it to build a simple paper clip factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the forest animals are not standing idly by and will face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an native from the region and will be in charge of strategically positioning the animals using the terrain available and the collectibles in the levels to finally expel these invaders in this reimagining of the classic chess game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/6a29d5d94ec40c9c9800939fd43157c5.apng?t=1761871206\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/6a29d5d94ec40c9c9800939fd43157c5.poster.avif?t=1761871206\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=640 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat the workers through several stages with multiple obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 stages available to play in solo or multiplayer mode and more will be released throughout development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/3d7692f989ac858367daabdf59da79fb.poster.avif?t=1761871206\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/3d7692f989ac858367daabdf59da79fb.webm?t=1761871206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/3d7692f989ac858367daabdf59da79fb.mp4?t=1761871206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the collectible power-ups on the field to dominate the match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly defined unique powers that can help or hinder your performance, all depending on your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/ce4404dd22e1cbd3887a9727edac62c5.poster.avif?t=1761871206\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/ce4404dd22e1cbd3887a9727edac62c5.webm?t=1761871206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/ce4404dd22e1cbd3887a9727edac62c5.mp4?t=1761871206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras/f864f9b36b9755f30f27fc0393da3028.avif?t=1761871206\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/extras_big/f864f9b36b9755f30f27fc0393da3028.avif?t=1761871206 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show these workers why they shouldn't mess with nature!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379110?t=1761871206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761871206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/1e81377bec1fa1446bc59ad21ac12d4c9378199e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761871206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379110/1e81377bec1fa1446bc59ad21ac12d4c9378199e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761871206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","